OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fgradually becoming confined to
OL,7,FCornwall and parts of Devon overnight.
OL,8,FStaying dry with plenty of clear
OL,9,Fspells elsewhere. Winds easing across
OL,10,Fthe region. Feeling cool for many.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FAny showers in the west
OL,13,Fwill ease through the morning, leaving
OL,14,Fa mostly dry and bright day with sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Light winds making it feel
OL,16,Fslightly warmer than Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
