OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FStaying changeable through the week,
OL,7,Fas another band of rain moves in from
OL,8,Fthe west on Thursday, before drier and
OL,9,Fbrighter weather returns on Friday and
OL,10,Fmuch of Saturday.
